Customize Studio UI while creating a SageMaker User Profile.

The purpose is simple:

You can choose which applications and Machine Learning tools the user will see inside SageMaker Studio.

===

1. Application buttons 📱

You can turn ON/OFF applications such as:

| Application        | Use                                            |
| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |
| 📓 **JupyterLab**  | Write and run Python, notebooks, data analysis |
| 💻 **Code Editor** | VS Code–like coding environment                |
| 🎨 **Canvas**      | Build ML models with low/no code               |
| 📊 **RStudio**     | R programming and statistical analysis         |
| 🔬 **MLflow**      | Track ML experiments, parameters, and models   |
| ☄️ **Comet**       | ML experiment tracking and monitoring          |
| **Deepchecks**     | Test and validate ML models/data               |
| **Fiddler**        | Monitor and analyze ML/AI models               |
| **Lakera Guard**   | AI/LLM security and protection                 |

====


